188	   * Test that verifies the resource leak fix for <a
189	   * href="https://github.com/google/guava/issues/5756">Issue #5756</a>.
190	   *
191	   * <p>This test covers a scenario where we write a smaller amount of data first, then write a
192	   * large amount that crosses the threshold (transitioning from "not at threshold" to "over the
193	   * threshold"). (We then write some more afterward.) This differs from the existing
194	   * testThreshold() which writes exactly enough bytes to fill the buffer, then immediately writes
195	   * more bytes.
196	   *
197	   * <p>Note: Direct testing of the {@link IOException} scenario during write/flush is challenging
198	   * without mocking. This test verifies that normal operation with threshold crossing still works
199	   * correctly with the fix in place.
